{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43262","headline":"清风戒寒 · 穆寂","name":"清风戒寒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风清物候残，萧洒报将寒。\n扫得天衢静，吹来眼界宽。\n条鸣方有异，虫思乱无端。\n就树收鲜腻，冲池起涩澜。\n过山岚可掬，度月色宜看。\n华实从兹始，何嗟岁序殚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"穆寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}